1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,981
Its first use: predicting displacement.

2
00:00:02,981 --> 00:00:07,968
A metal pushes out of solution any metal below it in the series.

3
00:00:07,968 --> 00:00:14,973
Zinc, at minus zero point seven six, displaces copper, at plus zero point three four.

4
00:00:14,973 --> 00:00:17,343
Copper cannot displace zinc.

